#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:5
msgid "Simulations"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:7
msgid ""
"A **simulation plugin** teaches PartCAD to run a physics simulator. It is "
"the third kind of implementation declared in the same form as :doc:`an "
"output type </plugins/output>` -- a ``path`` to a script, the sandbox that "
"script needs, and the parameters it is handed -- and it is what turns an "
"object's claim about its *behaviour* into something that can be checked."
msgstr ""
"**仿真插件** 教 PartCAD 去运行一个物理仿真器。它是第三种以与 :doc:`输出类型 </plugins/output>` "
"相同形式声明的实现 -- 一个指向脚本的 ``path`` 、那个脚本所需要的沙箱，以及交给它的参数 -- 而正是它把一个对象关于自身 *行为* "
"的断言变成可以被检查的东西。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:13
msgid ""
"A part says what it **is**. ``simulate:`` is where a part, an assembly or a "
"scene says what it is supposed to **do** once it is placed in a world and "
"the world is switched on -- or, more often, what it is supposed *not* to do:"
" not fall over, not slide off, not come apart. ``pc sim`` runs those, and "
"``pc test`` holds the object to them every time it runs, as its ``sim`` "
"check."
msgstr ""
"零件说明自己 **是** 什么。而 ``simulate:`` 是零件、装配体或场景说明自己在被放进一个世界、而这个世界被开启之后应该 **做** "
"什么的地方 -- 或者更常见的是，说明它应该 *不* 做什么：不倾倒、不滑落、不散开。``pc sim`` 运行这些断言，而 ``pc test`` "
"每次运行时都以它们来约束该对象，作为它的 ``sim`` 检查项。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:19
msgid ""
"**PartCAD ships no simulator.** It ships the concept -- this section, the "
"sandbox a plugin runs in, and the export a scene reaches the simulator "
"through -- and a package supplies the physics."
msgstr ""
"**PartCAD 不附带任何仿真器。** 它附带的是概念 -- 这个小节、插件所运行的那个沙箱，以及场景借以到达仿真器的那个导出 -- "
"而由某个包来提供物理。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:24
msgid "What a simulation plugin is for"
msgstr "仿真插件的用途"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Proving a behavioural requirement.** A ``simulate:`` entry that names a "
"``feature:`` of the object's ``requirements:`` becomes the evidence for that"
" feature, which is otherwise a sentence no program can measure."
msgstr ""
"**证明一项关于行为的需求。** 一个指名了该对象 ``requirements:`` 中某个 ``feature:`` 的 ``simulate:``"
" 条目，会成为该特性的证据；否则那就只是一句任何程序都无法测量的话。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Catching what geometry cannot show.** A stack that stands, a gripper that "
"holds, a robot that does not tip on a slope: nothing about the shapes says "
"any of it."
msgstr "**抓住几何无法显示的问题。** 一摞东西立得住、一个夹爪夹得牢、一台机器人在斜坡上不倾倒：这些形状本身对其中任何一点都没有说明。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Regression-testing motion.** The simulations run in ``pc test``, through "
"the cache, so a change that makes a mechanism bind is a failed check rather "
"than a discovery."
msgstr ""
"**对运动做回归测试。** 这些仿真会在 ``pc test`` 中运行，并走缓存，所以一个让机构卡死的改动会表现为一项检查失败，而不是某人偶然发现。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Wrapping one engine once.** A plugin brings the engine, the scene format "
"it reads and the vocabulary it reports in, so every package using it writes "
"the same kind of ``validation:``."
msgstr ""
"**把一个引擎只封装一次。** 插件带来引擎、它所读取的那种场景格式，以及它用来报告的那套词汇，于是每一个使用它的包写出来的 "
"``validation:`` 都是同一类。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:40
msgid "Using one"
msgstr "使用一个仿真插件"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:42
msgid "Declare the simulation on the object, naming the plugin by full path:"
msgstr "在对象上声明这个仿真，并用完整路径指名那个插件："

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:57
msgid ""
"What each key means is in :ref:`sim-declaring`, the scene an object is "
"placed in and how to write one in :ref:`sim-scenes`, and what a "
"``validation:`` is evaluated over in :ref:`sim-validation`."
msgstr ""
"每个键是什么意思见 :ref:`sim-declaring` ，对象被放进的那个场景以及如何编写一个场景见 :ref:`sim-scenes` ，而 "
"``validation:`` 是在什么之上求值的见 :ref:`sim-validation` 。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:61
msgid ""
"Every run is also asked for a picture of the scene before and after, taken "
"from where the scene is rendered from: the ``viewport_origin`` and "
"``viewport_up`` of its ``render: png:``, or of its package's when the scene "
"states none; see :doc:`/digital_thread/lifecycle/simulation`."
msgstr ""
"每次运行还会被要求提供场景在运行前后各一张图片，取自渲染该场景时所用的位置：也就是它 ``render: png:`` 中的 "
"``viewport_origin`` 和 ``viewport_up`` ，或者在场景什么都没写时取它所在包的那一组；参见 "
":doc:`/digital_thread/lifecycle/simulation` 。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:66
msgid "Then:"
msgstr "然后："

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:75
msgid ""
"Every run is also asked for a picture of the scene before and after, taken "
"from where the scene is rendered from: the ``viewport_origin`` and "
"``viewport_up`` of its ``render: png:``, or of its package's when the scene "
"states none."
msgstr ""
"每次运行还会被要求提供场景在运行前后各一张图片，取自渲染该场景时所用的位置：也就是它 ``render: png:`` 中的 "
"``viewport_origin`` 和 ``viewport_up`` ，或者在场景什么都没写时取它所在包的那一组。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:80
msgid "Writing one"
msgstr "编写一个仿真插件"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:82
msgid ""
"A simulation plugin is the third kind of implementation a package can "
"declare, beside the export and render ones of :ref:`output-files`, and it is"
" declared in exactly the same form -- a ``path`` to a script, the sandbox "
"that script needs, and the parameters it is handed:"
msgstr ""
"仿真插件是包可以声明的第三类实现，另外两类是 :ref:`output-files` 中的导出实现和渲染实现；它的声明形式与那两类完全相同——指向脚本的"
" ``path``、该脚本所需的沙箱，以及交给它的参数："

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:100
msgid ""
"The contract is narrow on purpose: **a scene with the subject in it goes in,"
" as a file in the format** ``format:`` **names, and JSON carrying** "
"``before`` **and** ``after`` **comes out.** The scene arrives as a file "
"because a simulator reads its own model format and PartCAD already knows how"
" to write several -- which is also what keeps a plugin free of any CAD "
"dependency."
msgstr ""
"这份约定是有意定得很窄的：**进去的是一个装有被测对象的场景，以** ``format:`` **所指明格式的文件形式进入；出来的是带有** "
"``before`` **和** ``after`` **的 JSON。** 场景以文件形式送达，是因为仿真器读的是它自己的模型格式，而 PartCAD"
" 已经知道如何写出好几种——这也正是插件得以不依赖任何 CAD 的原因。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:106
msgid ""
"The exporter for ``format:`` is looked up in the plugin's own package as "
"well as in the scene's, beneath it, which is how a plugin implements the "
"format it reads: an engine's scene format belongs to that engine's plugin, "
"so each plugin declares the ``export:`` that writes it beside the "
"``simulation:`` that runs it, and a package that re-tunes that export for "
"its own scenes still wins. ``formatOptions:`` is how the plugin asks for the"
" export -- a physics run wants every body free to move, the opposite of what"
" a scene means on its own."
msgstr ""
"``format:`` "
"所对应的导出器既会在该插件自己的包里查找，也会在场景所在包及其下方查找，而插件正是靠这一点来实现它所读取的那种格式：一个引擎的场景格式属于那个引擎的插件，所以每个插件都把写出该格式的"
" ``export:`` 与运行它的 ``simulation:`` "
"声明在一起；而一个为自己的场景重新调整了那个导出的包，仍然会胜出。``formatOptions:`` 则是插件向导出提出要求的方式 -- "
"一次物理运行希望每个刚体都能自由运动，这与场景本身所表达的恰好相反。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:114
msgid ""
"The script runs in a PartCAD sandbox with two globals. ``request`` holds the"
" plugin's declared parameters, overridden by the ``params:`` of the "
"declaration being run, and then ``scene_file`` (the absolute path of the "
"exported scene), ``scene_format``, ``scene_name``, ``subject`` (the full "
"path of the object being simulated), ``subject_kind`` and ``simulation`` "
"(the declaration's name). ``path`` is a directory the run may write anything"
" into -- a trajectory, a log -- which is kept and cached with the result. "
"The script sets ``output``, or defines ``process(path, request)`` returning "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"脚本在一个 PartCAD 沙箱中运行，带有两个全局变量。``request`` 装着插件所声明的参数，并被正在运行的那条声明的 ``params:``"
" 覆盖，然后还有 ``scene_file`` "
"（导出的场景的绝对路径）、``scene_format``、``scene_name``、``subject`` "
"（被仿真对象的完整路径）、``subject_kind`` 以及 ``simulation`` （该声明的名称）。``path`` "
"是一个目录，本次运行可以往里写任何东西 -- 一条轨迹、一份日志 -- 它会被保留并与结果一起缓存。脚本可以设置 ``output`` "
"，或者定义一个返回它的 ``process(path, request)`` ："

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:128
msgid ""
"A success without ``before`` and ``after``, each an object, is refused. What"
" is inside them, and anything else beside them, is the plugin's own "
"vocabulary: PartCAD carries it to the ``validation:`` expression and reads "
"none of it. The two plugins PartCAD maintains share one vocabulary, "
"described in :ref:`sim-validation`, and a plugin that reports the same is "
"one whose validations read the same."
msgstr ""
"一个成功的结果如果没有 ``before`` 和 ``after`` "
"（各自都是一个对象），就会被拒绝。它们内部装的东西、以及它们旁边的其他任何东西，都属于插件自己的词汇：PartCAD 只是把它带给 "
"``validation:`` 表达式，一点都不去读。PartCAD 维护的那两个插件共用同一套词汇，在 :ref:`sim-validation` "
"中有描述；而一个报告同样内容的插件，写出来的校验条件读起来也一样。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:136
msgid "An example"
msgstr "一个例子"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:138
msgid ""
"**PartCAD ships none of these.** A simulator is somebody's program with a "
"release cycle of its own, so PartCAD ships the concept -- this section, the "
"sandbox a plugin runs in, and the export a scene reaches it through -- and a"
" package supplies the physics. :ref:`sim-engines` lists the two there are."
msgstr ""
"**这些 PartCAD 一个都不附带。** 仿真器是某个人的程序，有它自己的发布周期，所以 PartCAD 附带的是概念 -- "
"这个小节、插件所运行的那个沙箱，以及场景借以到达它的那个导出 -- 而由某个包来提供物理。:ref:`sim-engines` 列出了现有的那两个。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:143
msgid ""
"Each of the two is one package carrying everything its format needs -- the "
":doc:`importer </plugins/importers>` that reads it, the :doc:`export type "
"</plugins/output>` that writes it, the :doc:`application entry "
"</plugins/applications>` that opens it, and the simulation plugin that runs "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"这两个当中的每一个都是一个包，带着它那种格式所需要的一切 -- 读取它的 :doc:`导入器 </plugins/importers>` 、写出它的 "
":doc:`导出类型 </plugins/output>` 、打开它的 :doc:`应用程序条目 </plugins/applications>` "
"，以及运行它的那个仿真插件："

