#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:162
msgid ""
"``examples/feature_simulate`` is the worked example. Its scenes are "
"arrangements of blocks that each declare a ``simulate:`` entry with a "
"``validation:`` over how far anything moved: ``stable`` is supposed to "
"stand, ``unstable``, ``slippery`` and ``tilted`` are supposed not to, and "
"``tank`` is filled with water so that buoyancy and drag are exercised too."
msgstr ""
"``examples/feature_simulate`` 就是那个完整的例子。它的各个场景都是方块的摆放，每一个都声明了一条带 "
"``validation:`` 的 ``simulate:`` 条目，用来判定有东西移动了多远：``stable`` 应该立得住，而 "
"``unstable``、``slippery`` 和 ``tilted`` 应该立不住，至于 ``tank`` "
"则注满了水，这样浮力和阻力也一并得到检验。"

#: ../../source/plugins/simulations.rst:175
msgid ""
":ref:`sim-engines` says what each engine models and what it does not, and "
":ref:`sim-validation` the vocabulary the two PartCAD maintains report in -- "
"a plugin that reports the same is one whose validations read the same."
msgstr ""
":ref:`sim-engines` 说明每个引擎建模了什么、没有建模什么，而 :ref:`sim-validation` 说明 PartCAD "
"维护的那两个插件所用来报告的词汇 -- 一个报告同样内容的插件，写出来的校验条件读起来也一样。"

